      ],
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "default",
          "text": "At Crossroads, several authenticated records refuse to fit the ordinary map. An arrival is logged where no road, gate, or ship accounts for it. A departure is confirmed by two offices that never shared a clerk. The sources corroborate an anomaly; they do not yet explain its mechanism, its cause, or whether it can be repeated.",
