      ],
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "default",
          "text": "The fifteenth duty closes the rotation and finally gives the scattered work a name. The Palace Concordance is the method that correlates authenticated evidence across domains. Behind it sits the protected Threshold Archive: records of rare crossings at a real inter-world Threshold. Your own arrival is filed among those anomalies. You now know enough to judge the Palace and choose your relationship to it. You still do not know what originally displaced you.",
          "conditions": [],
